Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.08,0:04:36.05,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Everyone, I would like for you all to meet Ramsey, Ramsey Stanton to be exact.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.91,0:04:41.44,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Why he helped put together a Bardonic convention just last week, all by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.21,0:04:43.63,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,A whole eight people showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.42,0:04:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sup, I think modern Sonic sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.36,0:04:51.84,Robotnik,,0,0,0,,Wow you're a Bardonic fan too, that's kind of sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.35,0:04:55.19,Robotnik,,0,0,0,,I almost want to suck your balls and call you papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.31,0:05:00.59,Robotnik,,0,0,0,,Haha, I'm just kidding. I won't, because I'm not gay, I'm straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.60,0:05:03.60,Sonic,,0,0,0,,Hey, I remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.03,0:05:06.88,Sonic,,0,0,0,,You're that guy who had me sign my name on your right butt cheek,
