Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.11,0:05:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think Bardonic is cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.95,0:05:15.52,Sonia,,0,0,0,,So you also like the Bartleby x Sonic ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.03,0:05:20.05,Sonia,,0,0,0,,That is pretty cool. We are Sonic's sibs if you didn't know that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.87,0:05:25.20,Sonia,,0,0,0,,Truth be told we're awfully busy, but you can take a picture with us if you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.28,0:05:31.25,Manic,,0,0,0,,How do you feel about the Mindy x Manic ship? My girlfriend has big boobies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.00,0:05:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No one cares about any of you guys, it's all about Sonic and Bartleby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.23,0:05:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It always has been.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.97,0:05:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the legendary Tamers12345 hasn't even bothered to make a Mindic video in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.03,0:05:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody gives a fucking shit. That's not to say Mindic is bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just that it pales in comparison to Bardonic, now leave me alone okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.62,0:05:57.63,Manic,,0,0,0,,Okay, we're sorry for taking up your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.37,0:06:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No you're not. If you really were sorry you wouldn't have done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.59,0:06:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So Bartleby and Bartleby's bitch, what brings you all the way out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:09.82,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Actually we were just on our way to summer camp,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.19,0:06:12.30,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,But it appears we have gotten sidetracked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.49,0:06:14.48,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't happen to know the way would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.68,0:06:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I thought I passed by some campgrounds during my morning walk,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.84,0:06:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't I take you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.63,0:06:25.67,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Yes, that sounds like a plan. Lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.92,0:06:41.62,Cyrus,,0,0,0,,Look everybody, we finally made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.97,0:06:53.91,Music,,0,0,0,,[Music]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.23,0:07:00.28,Athair,,0,0,0,,Why hello there everybody. I am pleased to see that you all made it here safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.22,0:07:03.55,Knuckles,,0,0,0,,Athair, you're finally out of the hospital!
