Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.44,0:07:26.65,Athair,,0,0,0,,The ninja actually came back again to get a piece of my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:32.74,Athair,,0,0,0,,He raped me, but man he shoved his fat balls deep in my ass,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.17,0:07:37.62,Athair,,0,0,0,,And it is only thanks to that, that I am able to stand here talking with you today.
