Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.25,0:23:20.04,Sonic,,0,0,0,,Jared, you're on my team, don't just stand there. Get over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.72,0:23:26.42,Jarred,,0,0,0,,Sonic, did you listen to what I said? I need to be on Bartleby's team so I can protect my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.82,0:23:29.49,Sonic,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and we need you on our team so we can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.75,0:23:34.45,Sonic,,0,0,0,,I understand you're worried Jared, but you're going to have to trust your girlfriend on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.09,0:23:39.44,Sonic,,0,0,0,,Trust that she won't willingly get fucked in the ass by your dad while your back is turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.74,0:23:45.02,Trevor,,0,0,0,,I was afraid I was going to be picked last. Nobody wants me to be on their team after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.20,0:23:46.93,Trevor,,0,0,0,,We should just go home Mandy,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.17,0:23:50.72,Trevor,,0,0,0,,And save ourselves the embarrassment of being told nobody likes us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.14,0:23:55.75,Mandy,,0,0,0,,Speak for yourself Trevor, Bartleby is going to choose me any second now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.07,0:23:57.90,Mandy,,0,0,0,,He's just playing hard to get.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.61,0:24:02.11,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Trevor, you are my last pick. Come over here and be on my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.82,0:24:09.73,Trevor,,0,0,0,,Bartleby did you really just say, did you really say I can be on your team?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.76,0:24:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[Applause]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.05,0:24:18.64,Trevor,,0,0,0,,So then I don't have to be with that loser Sonic?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.63,0:24:21.25,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Did you just call my bitch a loser?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.60,0:24:24.02,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Just for saying that I don't want you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.34,0:24:27.35,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Get out of my sight, you're going to be on Sonic's team instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.48,0:24:34.68,Cyrus,,0,0,0,,Well, would you look at that? It seems Bartleby didn't want you after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.68,0:24:36.88,Cyrus,,0,0,0,,[Farting]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.92,0:24:41.04,Cyrus,,0,0,0,,This is what you get. You don't mess with Cyrus of the freedom fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.36,0:24:42.96,Cyrus,,0,0,0,,[Farting]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.01,0:24:45.24,Cyrus,,0,0,0,,I'll keep going till you're fucking dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.41,0:24:45.84,Cyrus,,0,0,0,,[Farting]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.84,0:24:49.41,Cyrus,,0,0,0,,Choke on my stinky gas, and fucking die bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.44,0:24:55.79,Cyrus,,0,0,0,,[Farting]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.08,0:24:59.78,Athair,,0,0,0,,I see everybody is wearing their team colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.12,0:25:04.06,Athair,,0,0,0,,Am I correct in assuming you have your teams all picked out?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.22,0:25:07.20,Knuckles,,0,0,0,,Great grandfather Athair, you're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.87,0:25:11.89,Knuckles,,0,0,0,,Who's this guy with you? Athair, it's not another prostitute is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.24,0:25:16.55,Knuckles,,0,0,0,,Because the police said if they catch you talking to prostitutes again after the incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.55,0:25:18.19,Knuckles,,0,0,0,,You could get three years in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.79,0:25:24.11,Athair,,0,0,0,,Ah-haha, no Knuckles. Well, at least I don't think he's a prostitute.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.50,0:25:28.43,Athair,,0,0,0,,I found him peeing and pooping in the public restrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.52,0:25:32.06,Athair,,0,0,0,,He offered to be the referee for a dodge ball game this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.15,0:25:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct. Athair, you can take your hand off my ass now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.15,0:25:39.62,Athair,,0,0,0,,No, that's quite all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.59,0:25:45.14,Dingo,,0,0,0,,Wait, we're playing dodgeball? Nobody told me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.65,0:25:47.66,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Dingo, that's the whole reason we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.88,0:25:50.96,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Why do you think we were grouping up into teams in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.58,0:25:53.80,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Oh my God Dingo, you're so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.48,0:25:56.50,Jarred,,0,0,0,,Yeah Dingo, you are so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.49,0:26:00.45,Sleet,,0,0,0,,What the fuck did you just say about Dingo? You'd better take that back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.49,0:26:04.15,Mandy,,0,0,0,,I'm so excited to be on your team Bartleby.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.27,0:26:08.54,Mandy,,0,0,0,,Are you as excited as I am? Haha, let's have fun together.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.04,0:26:41.27,Music,,0,0,0,,[Music]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.29,0:26:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, is everyone separated into groups?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.93,0:26:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[Applause]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.03,0:26:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, it's time to begin the first game of the weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.56,0:26:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The dodgeball game will be using the usual rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.75,0:27:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If you get hit by a ball you're out. If someone catches the ball you threw you are also out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.32,0:27:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go Bartleby, here is your ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.31,0:27:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The match doesn't begin until you throw the first shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.29,0:27:16.39,Max,,0,0,0,,What sort of rules are those supposed to be? Explain why Bartleby gets to throw first?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.56,0:27:18.83,Max,,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound very fair to the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.83,0:27:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Bartleby paid me two thousand dollars to give him a free throw.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.95,0:27:31.81,Trevor,,0,0,0,,This sucks. I wanted to win, but now I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.50,0:27:38.66,Knuckles,,0,0,0,,Athair, can you drive me home? I don't really want to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.54,0:27:44.74,Robotnik,,0,0,0,,Can you drive me home too? You don't need to call my dad, he left and never came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.83,0:27:50.87,Flora,,0,0,0,,I don't think I want to play if Bartleby is, he's the best at pretty much everything anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.69,0:27:52.85,Sonia,,0,0,0,,I don't see the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.26,0:27:55.59,Manic,,0,0,0,,Because you're on the blue team sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.81,0:27:59.03,Manic,,0,0,0,,If Bartleby gets a free shot that means one of my teammates,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.44,0:28:01.68,Manic,,0,0,0,,A member of the pink team, will perish and fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.36,0:28:05.39,Manic,,0,0,0,,Bartleby is using money to win, like he always does.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.39,0:28:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[Music]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.55,0:28:13.05,Sonic,,0,0,0,,Bartleby, tell me what ails you, my lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.64,0:28:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the fourth time today that you killed another student,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.06,0:28:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Because your muscles are too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.65,0:28:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,iIm afraid I'm going to have to call your daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.27,0:28:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,From this day forth, as your coach I must forbid you from ever playing dodgeball
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.09,0:28:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,in my basketball court ever ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.33,0:28:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, if I see you playing dodgeball anywhere else I'm calling the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.39,0:28:55.75,Music,,0,0,0,,[Music]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.76,0:29:00.51,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Bitch, I wanted to keep this from you, but I'm afraid I can't keep it a secret any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.45,0:29:02.69,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,When I was three years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.82,0:29:06.36,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,I was on a pro-league dodgeball team called the almighty ball bashers.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.33,0:29:10.38,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,I was such a pro in fact that nobody would want to play with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.00,0:29:14.60,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Even the adult players lived in fear of my raw and unbridled power.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.98,0:29:19.82,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,I guess I just got so excited to play again, but I ended up ruining the fun for all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.92,0:29:25.72,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,I wanted to feel those balls once more that I paid two thousand dollars to get to hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.55,0:29:30.77,Sonic,,0,0,0,,It's okay Bartleby, we understand everything now. You can play with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.73,0:29:32.32,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,I can?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.77,0:29:37.61,Sonic,,0,0,0,,Of course, as long as you pull back on your throws and don't decapitate any of our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.05,0:29:41.16,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,I promise you bitch, I'll go easy on you just this once,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.42,0:29:43.67,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,For this chance that you have given me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.44,0:29:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the dodgeball game begin. Everyone give it all you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.43,0:29:53.98,Jarred,,0,0,0,,It was nice knowing you boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.91,0:29:59.05,Sonic,,0,0,0,,Don't be scared Jared, Bartleby said he would be going easy on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.29,0:30:04.16,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Everyone aim for my Bitch. He's fat, he can't outrun all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.77,0:30:10.43,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Break his arms, don't allow him any means of escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.19,0:30:29.28,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you doing anything? Throw the ball as I told you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.44,0:30:39.89,Sonia,,0,0,0,,I, I can't. I just can't do it. He's my brother and he's already out. It wouldn't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.59,0:30:48.11,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Anyone else? I'm ready to go to jail tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.78,0:30:52.83,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,I'll take that silence as a no. Grab your big balls and do my bidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.26,0:31:01.08,Jarred,,0,0,0,,Come on, we have to push forward. We're dead if we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.01,0:31:04.70,Manic,,0,0,0,,It's not worth it Jared, they have the whole area covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.38,0:31:09.93,Knuckles,,0,0,0,,Either way we have to create a path. Let's send a decoy to draw fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.49,0:31:12.50,Manic,,0,0,0,,You want us to send a man to his death?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.08,0:31:16.90,Manic,,0,0,0,,That's crazy talk Knuckles, nobody is willing to agree to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.73,0:31:21.93,Max,,0,0,0,,I think it's a great idea. You there, better get a move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.64,0:31:23.89,Sleet,,0,0,0,,What? Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.47,0:31:27.38,Max,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you forgot about what happened, way back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.71,0:31:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? And now we're gonna bust the both of ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.78,0:31:52.48,Sleet,,0,0,0,,And who pray tell is going to believe a gaggle of underage pickpockets like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.82,0:31:55.17,Dingo,,0,0,0,,Anyone! Max was videotaping us!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.66,0:31:56.42,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Grab him!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.01,0:32:02.30,Max,,0,0,0,,You falsely accused my crew for a crime that they didn't even commit,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.61,0:32:07.49,Max,,0,0,0,,And you got away with all the glory. Now it's time for you to face justice for your actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.89,0:32:12.06,Max,,0,0,0,,I can't think of a more fitting punishment than taking on Bartleby Montclair of Dresden.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.71,0:32:17.72,Sleet,,0,0,0,,No, please don't make me do this. I don't want to die like this, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.93,0:32:22.18,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Ow!, you're nothing but a thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.88,0:32:23.81,Manic,,0,0,0,,Max no!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.68,0:32:26.32,Max,,0,0,0,,Don't try and protect him Manic.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.88,0:32:31.30,Manic,,0,0,0,,If you do this, then you're no better than they are. Revenge doesn't solve anything
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.26,0:32:35.88,Max,,0,0,0,,Don't act like you understand me Manic. I grew up on the streets without a home.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.14,0:32:38.07,Max,,0,0,0,,It's a whole different world than the one you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.71,0:32:41.40,Manic,,0,0,0,,Max, we grew up on the streets in the same neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.96,0:32:43.73,Manic,,0,0,0,,We even have the same hairstyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.78,0:32:47.43,Max,,0,0,0,,What are you still sticking around here for? Get a move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.12,0:32:56.31,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,All right! Looks like we got ourselves a fresh one boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.05,0:33:11.76,Mindy's dad,,0,0,0,,Mandy you fool, hurry back before Bartleby sees your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.47,0:33:15.52,Flora,,0,0,0,,My name isn't Mandy, it's Flora.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.45,0:33:18.15,Mindy's dad,,0,0,0,,That's literally what I just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.58,0:33:23.94,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,[Laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.02,0:33:25.28,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,[Farting]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.99,0:33:27.70,Mindy's dad,,0,0,0,,Mandy run!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.34,0:33:49.80,Music,,0,0,0,,[Music]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.82,0:33:50.61,Mindy's dad,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.61,0:33:55.54,Mindy's dad,,0,0,0,,[Farting]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.08,0:34:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mindy's dad, you're out of the game. Please remove yourself from the playing field.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.17,0:34:09.67,Mindy's dad,,0,0,0,,Wrong. I'm not leaving until I see my underage daughter's huge milk jugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.16,0:34:16.40,Mindy,,0,0,0,,Oh gee! Look what you've done now daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.16,0:34:20.61,Mindy,,0,0,0,,Now I'm going to have to play the rest of the game with my ass and tits out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.53,0:34:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, those boobs look fake as shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.22,0:34:29.90,Aleena,,0,0,0,,Hey, you need to take it easy. Some of my kids are over on that team.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.83,0:34:31.78,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Shut up Karen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.62,0:34:38.50,Uncle Chuck,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's my sister you're talking to. You better show her some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.49,0:34:40.29,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Okay boomer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.89,0:34:44.56,Aleena,,0,0,0,,You know, if my husband were here he wouldn't let you be doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.62,0:34:48.70,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,You mean the father of Sonic the Hedgehog? Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.95,0:34:53.77,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,His son is my Bitch. I have neither the reason nor care to fear that worthless man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.37,0:34:58.59,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,The only good thing about him is that his ass might be big since he's my bitch's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.01,0:35:01.62,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Now get out of my way and don't cross me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.63,0:35:07.96,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,And if daddy ever comes home that message goes for him too. Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.36,0:35:14.33,Uncle Chuck,,0,0,0,,Aleena, are you going to be okay? Don't listen to what that sexy hunk of a man said.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.77,0:35:18.68,Aleena,,0,0,0,,Not now Charles, I just... Let me be alone for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.30,0:35:23.07,Uncle Chuck,,0,0,0,,But it's obvious what Bartleby said got to you. Let's talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.29,0:35:29.29,Uncle Chuck,,0,0,0,,We can bring over the kids and deal with this as a family. Isn't that what a family is for...?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.09,0:35:34.56,Aleena,,0,0,0,,Look, I know you're just trying to help but no one can ever replace him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.99,0:35:36.81,Aleena,,0,0,0,,So would you let me deal with it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.81,0:35:42.17,Uncle Chuck,,0,0,0,,I understand that... But when someone makes fun of you, my own sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.30,0:35:44.46,Uncle Chuck,,0,0,0,,I can't just stand by and do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.57,0:35:48.78,Uncle Chuck,,0,0,0,,You... The kids... You're all special to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.35,0:35:50.52,Uncle Chuck,,0,0,0,,That's why I want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.10,0:35:57.40,Uncle Chuck,,0,0,0,,No one can ever replace your husband. Of course they can't. And I would never dream of trying. 
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.81,0:36:06.15,Uncle Chuck,,0,0,0,,But I can do my absolute best to still give Sonic, Manic, Sonia, and you, some semblance of guidance and love since he's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.15,0:36:09.90,Music,,0,0,0,,[Music]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.90,0:36:13.92,Music,,0,0,0,,The seasons come and go like thoughts of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.16,0:36:21.66,Music,,0,0,0,,Like a wave returns to the sea into the blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.64,0:36:29.43,Music,,0,0,0,,And they change but in a cycle that I can lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.44,0:36:35.71,Music,,0,0,0,,Each painful but delightful to live through.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.88,0:36:43.51,Music,,0,0,0,,You came into my life, just like another season,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.55,0:36:45.57,Music,,0,0,0,,Not for long, just a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.94,0:36:49.68,Aleena,,0,0,0,,It's all in the past, right? Come on, we should get back to the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.42,0:36:53.34,Uncle Chuck,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're probably right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.05,0:37:05.24,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,[Growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.43,0:37:18.70,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well. I didn't expect to see you here today father.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.88,0:37:20.52,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Weren't you out buying North Korea?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.52,0:37:27.75,Bartleby's dad,,0,0,0,,I was, but then I heard rumors that you once again returned to your old ball basher days.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.86,0:37:33.20,Bartleby's dad,,0,0,0,,I simply could not believe it and had to come see for myself. Ah ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.37,0:37:37.25,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Well now that you witnessed what you came for go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.67,0:37:39.74,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,As you can see we are in the midst of a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.86,0:37:42.75,Bartleby's dad,,0,0,0,,Don't be like that boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.78,0:37:48.16,Bartleby's dad,,0,0,0,,Look, your Dad even brought ice pops pulled straight from the glaciers of Antarctica,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.47,0:37:51.30,Bartleby's dad,,0,0,0,,No less than 20 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.96,0:37:53.36,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,That's just like you, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.71,0:37:57.55,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Trying to win me and my friends over with freezy pops made for rich people.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.43,0:38:05.46,Bartleby's dad,,0,0,0,,Can you blame me? I needed to bring a proper gift if I want to see my stubborn son.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.30,0:38:10.23,Sonia,,0,0,0,,Oh boy, I sure do love freezy pops. We all get one?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.04,0:38:18.34,Bartleby's dad,,0,0,0,,You sure can. Everybody gather around and no complaining about what color you get.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.07,0:38:26.10,Bartleby's dad,,0,0,0,,Here you go son, this one's for you. No complaining now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.02,0:38:30.35,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,But, but I wanted banana. I don't even like blueberry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.12,0:38:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for bringing snacks to the summer campgrounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.82,0:38:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The tired kids will all really appreciate it after the hard work they did during the last game.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.03,0:38:43.17,Bartleby's dad,,0,0,0,,Don't talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.88,0:38:46.62,Sonic,,0,0,0,,Um, Mr Montclair, may I please have a freezy pop?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.42,0:38:50.93,Sonic,,0,0,0,,I love them. It's, it's not like it's because I'm fat or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.89,0:38:57.63,Sonic,,0,0,0,,Oh wow, banana! That's my favorite flavor in the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.01,0:38:59.58,Sonic,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much Mr Montclair.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.83,0:39:03.73,Trevor,,0,0,0,,Don't put those away yet, I also want a freezy pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.83,0:39:10.72,Trevor,,0,0,0,,Grape flavor? I'm not black! Are you saying that I look like a fucking nigger?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.04,0:39:13.66,Sonic,,0,0,0,,If you don't want it you can give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.01,0:39:24.45,Sonia,,0,0,0,,Hi Knux, how's it going? Did you get a freezy pop yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.85,0:39:27.48,Sonia,,0,0,0,,Bartleby's dad brought them over.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.93,0:39:32.90,Sonia,,0,0,0,,Apparently every ice pop cost 20,000 bucks because they have gold flakes in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.49,0:39:35.00,Sonia,,0,0,0,,Whatever the fuck that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.26,0:39:40.52,Knuckles,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened to you? You didn't accidentally end up on the wrong team right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.48,0:39:44.67,Sonia,,0,0,0,,Bartleby got mad during the dodgeball game and turned on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.61,0:39:48.48,Sonia,,0,0,0,,He says I'm not allowed to talk to any of my teammates,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.05,0:39:51.26,Sonia,,0,0,0,,So I came over to talk with you instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.18,0:39:54.63,Sonia,,0,0,0,,So who do you think is going to win the next games?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.90,0:39:59.19,Knuckles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think bitch? No one on my team wants to keep playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.45,0:40:03.96,Knuckles,,0,0,0,,And honestly, we were planning on forfeiting anyway so Bartley doesn't fucking kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.32,0:40:08.04,Sonia,,0,0,0,,But what if you win? winning gives you such a rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.64,0:40:09.59,Knuckles,,0,0,0,,i'm fine either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.53,0:40:12.75,Sonia,,0,0,0,,But if you lose you'll hang your head in shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.77,0:40:14.72,Knuckles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather live.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.48,0:40:25.53,Flora,,0,0,0,,Mindy, would you mind offering me a hand please?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.56,0:40:28.84,Flora,,0,0,0,,This freezy pop just won't open for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.67,0:40:31.61,Mindy,,0,0,0,,I got you bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.24,0:40:32.90,Flora,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.51,0:40:38.34,Mindy,,0,0,0,,Give me that. Hey Mandy, go long.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.04,0:40:40.47,Flora,,0,0,0,,Oh no Mindy, please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.37,0:40:45.30,Flora,,0,0,0,,Please stop it, this isn't funny girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.03,0:40:48.65,Mandy,,0,0,0,,Speak for yourself fag. Go fetch.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.25,0:40:53.82,Flora,,0,0,0,,Stop! Give me my freezy pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.88,0:40:58.06,Mindy,,0,0,0,,You want your frizzy pop? Here, you can have it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.38,0:41:21.52,Mindy,,0,0,0,,[Laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.44,0:41:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay kids, throw your popsicle wrappers in the garbage bin.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.55,0:41:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to start setting up for the next game.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.09,0:41:35.00,Sonic,,0,0,0,,About that coach... We uh, we don't really plan on playing any more of the games.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.52,0:41:39.05,Sonic,,0,0,0,,Can we just roast marshmallows or go tell camper stories?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.76,0:41:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well if you don't play that means you're going to have to forfeit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.33,0:41:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The blue team will be declared the winners. Are you okay with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.11,0:41:50.87,Sonic,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we kind of already knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.35,0:41:56.32,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Unacceptable. Such cowardice shall not be permitted.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.05,0:42:00.31,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,My daddy took time out of his day to come all the way down here,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.86,0:42:04.54,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,And I need to display dominance over my daddy by showing how good I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.05,0:42:08.62,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,So I want you to send your least hurt team member towards the battlefield,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.13,0:42:11.93,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,And we shall do battle one on one, mano eh mano.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.13,0:42:14.42,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Like how you duel in Yu-Gi-Oh: Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.93,0:42:16.80,Manic,,0,0,0,,Get going bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.46,0:42:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The rules for the game of tug-of-war are simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.01,0:42:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You both simultaneously exert strength to pull the rope as hard as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.24,0:42:30.83,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.11,0:42:32.00,Sonic,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.36,0:42:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever pulls the weakest will be pulled to the other side of the line,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.24,0:42:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And if such a thing happens you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.12,0:42:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll start on the count of zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.22,0:42:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sonic and Bartleby, are you ready to begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.61,0:42:47.96,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Bitch get up. You're wasting everyone's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.16,0:42:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Three, two,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.87,0:42:52.78,Sonic,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.11,0:42:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Bartleby you pulled on two, I'm afraid that warrants you a yellow card.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.84,0:43:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you earn any more you will be kicked from the game and it will count as a loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.06,0:43:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We will start again.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.25,0:43:08.79,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,It's your fault bitch! You broke my concentration with your big ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.40,0:43:13.28,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Get up you bitch! I refuse to lose because of your own incompetence.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.72,0:43:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sonic get up now. If you refuse to stand you're a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.61,0:43:49.95,Music,,0,0,0,,[Music]
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.95,0:43:53.92,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,What's the matter bitch? You didn't get hurt during the last game did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.90,0:43:56.39,Sonic,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me Bartleby.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.56,0:43:58.45,Sonic,,0,0,0,,I'm having fun just being here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.04,0:44:04.38,Sonic,,0,0,0,,Watching you have fun like this, it's the special moments like these that I really treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.50,0:44:07.09,Sonic,,0,0,0,,So let's give it everything we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.85,0:44:10.60,Sonic,,0,0,0,,Please show me what the almighty ball basher is capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.17,0:44:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you both ready? Okay. Three, two, one, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.10,0:44:32.70,Sonic,,0,0,0,,[Screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.71,0:44:41.91,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Bitch, bitch! Wake bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.30,0:44:44.68,Sonic,,0,0,0,,Bartleby, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.18,0:44:51.67,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Look at that. I told you he'd be fine everyone, ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.82,0:44:55.58,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,You gave your loved ones quite the scare, my plump sweet sugar baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.08,0:44:59.33,Sonic,,0,0,0,,What, what happened in the match? Did I lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.35,0:45:04.02,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Yes you did, but that's only natural since you were up against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.18,0:45:05.37,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,But that's not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.47,0:45:09.41,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,What is is that you yourself never gave up, and I think that makes you a real winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.20,0:45:12.84,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,I mean, not a real winner like me, but still a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.70,0:45:17.45,Sonic,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's everyone? Where did everybody go?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.11,0:45:22.33,Aleena,,0,0,0,,Everyone else already left to go get Long John Silver's.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.55,0:45:25.85,Aleena,,0,0,0,,We wanted to go too, but Manic wouldn't leave until you woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.85,0:45:32.23,Uncle Chuck,,0,0,0,,Fuck you you piece of shit! I hope you die chocking on Bartleby's massive hairy balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.04,0:45:37.14,Sonic,,0,0,0,,Oh boy, Long John Silver's! Can we go get some before they close Bartleby?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.35,0:45:39.24,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Sure thing bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.39,0:45:43.65,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Maybe John himself will lend me his spatula so I can beat that meat on your backside,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.03,0:45:45.05,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,If you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.38,0:45:48.63,Sonic,,0,0,0,,Haha, I get it! Like fuck my butt cheeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.41,0:45:51.67,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Did you have fun bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.12,0:45:52.89,Sonic,,0,0,0,,Yes daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.59,0:45:56.67,Sonic,,0,0,0,,I'll have even more fun when you choke me out with your ass tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.98,0:45:59.34,Bartleby,,0,0,0,,Oh bitch, you're so funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.59,0:46:01.34,Sonic,,0,0,0,,I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.99,0:46:16.45,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,Kids, dress me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.52,0:46:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you collect the valuable data you needed boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.85,0:46:38.46,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,Yes, I gathered all the intel I needed on the Sonic Underground's abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.74,0:46:41.64,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,The dodgeball game idea worked like a charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.06,0:46:47.03,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,I will make you a grilled cheese, and give you a little tickle on the ballsack as a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.18,0:46:52.36,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,When we get back to the van, remind me when we get there in case I forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.17,0:46:59.43,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,We should make haste precious children,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.59,0:47:04.28,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,I'm certain Bartleby saw through my disguise the moment he laid eyes upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.64,0:47:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying professor? You mean Bartleby knew all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.35,0:47:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But why didn't he do anything to stop us?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.42,0:47:17.56,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,I can only think that he refused to act because he did not want to ruin his fucking bitch's day.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.40,0:47:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew this job was going to be dangerous boss, but this is getting too risky?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.85,0:47:28.47,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,Not as dangerous as when I fucked your ass behind the police station last week,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.67,0:47:29.61,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,Timothy John.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.20,0:47:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[Screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.82,0:47:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[Farting]
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.16,0:47:41.01,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,Timothy, what is wrong lad?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.81,0:47:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's somebody here. I think they killed me with the fucking death note!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.97,0:47:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here professor, you might be next!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.44,0:47:51.34,Music,,0,0,0,,[Music]
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.34,0:47:54.41,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Show yourself at once retard!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.37,0:47:58.77,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,Why are you killing my precious children?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.77,0:47:59.99,Music,,0,0,0,,[Music]
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.99,0:48:04.12,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're Light Yagami. Wait a minute, are you Kira?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.93,0:48:08.42,Kira,,0,0,0,,Maybe I am, maybe I'm not. What's it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.30,0:48:12.48,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,Well if you aren't Kira, then tell me why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.79,0:48:16.03,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,And why I shouldn't sick my children on you this instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.97,0:48:19.49,Kira,,0,0,0,,Quit talking. Your hat looks like a pizza box.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.14,0:48:24.45,Kira,,0,0,0,,Just so you're aware, when you mess with the Sonic Underground, you mess with Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.18,0:48:28.09,Kira,,0,0,0,,And Kira told me to tell you that you need to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.93,0:48:31.74,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and who's going to make me? Kira?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.92,0:48:35.09,Kira,,0,0,0,,Perhaps. Let's go Ryuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.38,0:48:37.93,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,Who are you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.08,0:48:40.58,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,Nobody is there. Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.50,0:48:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember Light, they can't see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.70,0:48:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Only those who are in possession of a death note can see a shinigami.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.72,0:48:52.96,Kira,,0,0,0,,Those are my terms Majorchord, I suggest you follow them.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.17,0:48:55.81,Kira,,0,0,0,,Your days trying to destroy Sonic Underground are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.98,0:48:57.52,Kira,,0,0,0,,If you don't play by my rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.58,0:49:01.62,Kira,,0,0,0,,Well, let's just say things won't end quite the way you want them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.52,0:49:12.70,Kira,,0,0,0,,[Laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.61,0:49:26.26,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,What are you standing around for? I said keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.60,0:49:30.86,Athair,,0,0,0,,Please let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.12,0:49:35.92,Athair,,0,0,0,,I already told you, if it's money you want I will give you everything I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.98,0:49:37.56,Athair,,0,0,0,,I will even suck your balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.83,0:49:40.48,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,Shut up bitch, I don't need your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.98,0:49:43.79,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,Hey Robert, I got a new pal for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.10,0:49:47.84,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,Maybe now you won't be so lonely in that jail cell of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.22,0:49:58.98,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,Finally my plan to destroy the Sonic Underground has almost come to fruition.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.16,0:50:02.49,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,Now that I have Knuckles the Echidna's great grandfather,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.76,0:50:06.66,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,I can use him as leverage to get whatever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.99,0:50:14.59,Music,,0,0,0,,[Music]
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.59,0:50:18.33,Robert,,0,0,0,,I see now... You didn't lock me in here to keep me trapped in here...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.79,0:50:23.43,Robert,,0,0,0,,You locked me in here to keep me from getting out... Because I'm a threat to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.50,0:50:28.71,Robert,,0,0,0,,The truth is, Professor Majorchord... is that the one really trapped in here is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.17,0:50:30.95,Robert,,0,0,0,,Trapped... in a cage of fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.27,0:50:35.10,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,Me, trapped in a cage of fear? Bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.40,0:50:40.34,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,I'm not scared of you or anybody else. I am above even God Himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.65,0:50:43.38,Athair,,0,0,0,,That's not true, nobody is above God.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.11,0:50:47.65,Athair,,0,0,0,,How dare you speak of God's name in vain!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.12,0:50:53.92,Athair,,0,0,0,,As long as Robert and I keep praying, God and His almighty light will protect us from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.90,0:50:57.90,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,But can God protect you from this fucking gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.12,0:51:01.15,Robert,,0,0,0,,Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.05,0:51:07.06,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,Now let's see if God can stop me from forcing you to suck my fucking balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.47,0:51:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[Screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.17,0:51:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your name is Ramsey Spanton right?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.80,0:51:26.30,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,Ha, your last name sure sounds a lot like spanking, which is a huge coincidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.46,0:51:29.57,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,Cause that's what I'm going to be doing to you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.05,0:51:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do whatever you want with my fat ass,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.97,0:51:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But you will never defeat the Sonic Underground!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.62,0:51:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I will make sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.88,0:51:40.57,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,Then I guess our little talk here is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.87,0:51:45.41,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,You three had better have your pants off by the time I come here at midnight,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.41,0:51:47.04,Professor Majorchord,,0,0,0,,Or you're going to regret it.
